{"title":"Convex hull","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>convex hull</b> of a set of points is the smallest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Convex_set\" title=\"Convex set\">convex set</a> containing them. Convex hulls are very important in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">geometry</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Combinatorics\" title=\"Combinatorics\">combinatorics</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Convex_hull&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Convex_polygon\" title=\"Convex polygon\">Convex polygon</a>\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Convex_hull&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017161735\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.589      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.589      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2221:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017161735 and revision id 23715. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}